==Description==
The '''Carrots Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained at Level 17 of the premium [[Spring Frenzy Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{Bunz|520}} or {{Robux|94}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{Bunz|4,320}} or {{Robux|1,276}}.

The '''Carrots Nametag''' has orange text with a green diagonal gradient and a darker outline. Carrots, green leaves and orange sparkles emit from the text. Green smoke appears behind the text.

